sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant E as Edge/CDN
    participant G as API Gateway
    participant A as App Core
    participant C as Cache
    participant D as Database
    participant Q as Queue
    participant W as Worker

    U->>E: HTTP request
    E->>G: Forward filtered request
    G->>A: Authenticated request
    A->>C: Read hot key
    alt Cache hit
        C-->>A: Cached response
    else Cache miss
        A->>D: Query transactional data
        D-->>A: Data
        A->>C: Refresh cache
    end
    A-->>G: API response
    G-->>E: Response
    E-->>U: Final response

    A->>Q: Emit async job
    Q->>W: Deliver job
    W->>D: Persist job result
